# Sailfish OS: do not start Xiaomi's vibrator HAL.
#
# At start it plays effect 197 on the awinic_haptic input device, a streaming
# (RTP) effect that waits for data from Xiaomi's haptics framework. Nothing
# feeds it here, so the driver's single work queue stays blocked in
# aw86927_rtp_work_routine and every later vibration request is queued behind
# it: no haptics at all. ngfd drives the same input device directly
# (ffmemless plugin), so the HAL is not needed.
